silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_kgnode_mittens a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.02_bridge_to_shacl_validation.concrete_anchor.kgnode_mittens" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_kgnode_mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensKnowledgeGraphNode is KGNode_Mittens is the RDF node in the knowledge graph that represents Mittens's vet record — an rdf:Resource typed as a vet-record shape. Concretely: a SPARQL endpoint entry with triples like <Mittens_URI> rdf:type ex:VetRecord, with weight, vaccination date, and breed properties." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_conformant_report a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.02_bridge_to_shacl_validation.concrete_anchor.conformant_report" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_conformant_report silm:hasLongDescription "The SHACLConformantValidationReport is ConformantReport is the SHACL validation report object emitted when KGNode_Mittens passes all declared shapes. It contains sh:conforms true, a list of sh:ValidationResult (empty for full conformance), and a timestamp. This is NOT the vet record itself — it is the typed certification that the vet record node is shape-conformant." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_kgnode_mittens_prime a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.02_bridge_to_shacl_validation.concrete_anchor.kgnode_mittens_prime" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_kgnode_mittens_prime silm:hasLongDescription "The TransformedMittensKnowledgeGraphNode is KGNode_Mittens' is KGNode_Mittens after a compatible graph transformation — e.g., after adding a new triple recording Mittens's updated weight (a delta merge from a replica). The transformation is compatible if it preserves the aboutness arrow to Mittens." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_conformant_report_prime a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.02_bridge_to_shacl_validation.concrete_anchor.conformant_report_prime" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_conformant_report_prime silm:hasLongDescription "The TransportedConformantReport is ConformantReport' is the validation report after transportReport — the derived report for the transformed KGNode_Mittens'. Naturality says: computing V_SHACL(KGNode_Mittens') gives the same answer as applying transportReport to V_SHACL(KGNode_Mittens). The vet-record shape gate commutes with compatible updates." .
